<title>CHINA: China Jan-March cotton imports up 9.1 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>China Jan-March cotton imports up 9.1 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>China imported 230,000 tonnes of cotton in the first three months, up by 9.1 percent compared with the year-ago period, customs figures showed on Friday.</p>
<p>	   IMPORTS JAN-MARCH   MARCH	YR/YR PCTAGE CHANGE</p>
<p> Cotton     230,000	    70,000	 + 9.1</p>
<p>	   EXPORTS JAN-MARCH   MARCH	YR/YR PCTAGE CHANGE</p>
<p> Cotton	    11		  11	 -97.7</p>
<p>Cotton exports in January and February were zero, compared with 470 tonnes in the first two months of last year, the figures showed.</p>
<p>-- Beijing Newsroom (8610) 6532 1921</p>
</text>
